a&_nc_ohc=w6qBLt44PDwQ7kNvwHX6dAw&_nc_oc=AdoTDcjSw0cAt2onHszcx2Q66lQsh405apLqkZWO-dEs4FcajtjATV5JqUOz-ZubKpE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSzP5ywseKIVkTDKLK0VmwApX6UaGAcZ-5LNPMlld10Gg&oe=6AF49CCC"}, {"file_name": "Image Sequence_006_0000.png", "id": "1522547975652914", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1522547978986247_2551104668608319938_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_Fxd7nJmlYgQ7kNvwH78res&_nc_oc=AdrjNIPDTyOSL2fd0CiIHfB2en2-nmjxcTKaAl-GhOZGKGf41QDeRs77MCffknWnBFw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQXUch8nOsVW_M3c8WvqVV6ugZfFkRJfBNCAPy8fZwy7Q&oe=6AF48005"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Nomad Shooter", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "sport", "arcade", "training"], "long_description": "# Nomad Shooter\n\nA VR archery challenge that rewards a steady hand, a clean release, and the satisfaction of a true shot. Step into the role of a steppe archer and put your skill to the test.\n\n**Earn Every Shot**\n\nThere are no shortcuts to the next trial. Earn the score you need to advance, learn from every miss, and come back with better timing and a steadier hand. The further you go, the more each shot demands: judgment, patience, and the nerve to release at the right moment.\n\n**Master the Bow**\n\nTrain at your own pace or go for a cleaner run. A master archer guides you, but only you can make the shot.\n\n**Breathe. Draw. Release.**", "short_description": "Draw the bow, make a clean release, and watch your arrow fly true. In Nomad Shooter, you become a steppe archer, training at your own pace and facing trials that demand greater focus with every shot."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://crocos.kz/politika-konfidenczialnosti-nomad-shooter", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CROCOS GAMES", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://crocos.kz